          "text": "Right upper quadrant and epigastric pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Two episodes over approximately 3 weeks of sudden severe colicky/pressure pain radiating to the right shoulder/scapula, lasting approximately 2 hours and resolving spontaneously. Both episodes followed very fatty takeaway meals. No previous similar pain. No current pain today."
      }
    },
    {
